    "%@ answered, but it isn’t a Witerm continuation server. If Witerm runs behind a reverse proxy such as nginx, check that the proxy forwards /v1/ and /readyz." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ answered, but it isn’t a Witerm continuation server. If Witerm runs behind a reverse proxy such as nginx, check that the proxy forwards /v1/ and /readyz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 有响应，但它不是 Witerm 接续服务器。如果 Witerm 运行在 nginx 等反向代理之后，请确认代理转发了 /v1/ 和 /readyz。"
